      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STEEL WILL (3) bumped into a couple of smart types in his first prep, then returned with a slashing 6 len on speed victory over 1100m at Wyong in fast time. Can go on with it here and progress quickly this time in. PLAGIARISM (1) four-start Maiden who resumes a gelding. Gave his all in Group company over the two preps and looks ready to go with the two sharp trial placings. Finally drawn a decent gate and shapes as a genuine top three contender with Tim Clark aboard. THRILL HUNTER (2) Kirkham winner on debut last October. Resumed with a closing fourth after being held up in the straight when fourth over 1100m at Randwick. Desperate for this trip and should appreciate a bit more galloping room here. SAVVY DIAMOND (7) didn't beat much on debut when she led throughout to score in a slogging victory over 1100m at Goulburn. Should keep improving as she steps up in trip. LETTERS PATENT (4) comes here with a fitness edge over these and deserves another chance.",
